ersive and dynamic movement experience. Dash through snowy landscapes, leap over obstacles, and climb to strategic vantage points as you engage in epic snowball battles. The game features both single player and multiplayer!", "short_description": "Overview\nWelcome to Snowball Fight Beta, the new version of the SnowballFightBeta! Step into the frosty world where you, a courageous snowman, must master the art of gorilla locomotion to outmaneuver your opponents. This game takes inspiration from the beloved Gorilla Tag series, blending its unique movement mechanics with the thrill of a classic snowball fight.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Leykes Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/snowball-fight-beta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jupiter", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/snowballfightbetawebsite", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27258258227100653"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619805_4018159968476535_5528523184171536028_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7I5tIN64TjwQ7kNvwGuy8N9&_nc_oc=Ado9aSGfM-0MjsoAhV_pe0mGsC10EbhNVx__WotBcoIYYzjMk3bYVWjJFZhnxhbXUkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oc